    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, im planning this huge gala for a law firm next month, like 500 people. I just got a bunch of last minute emails about severe nut allergies and some vegan requests. whats the best way to tell the catering team about this so nothing gets missed and how should we label the food at the buffet so people dont get confused or sick?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
