      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Consider sending a detailed email to the catering team with the necessary information, including the specific allergy and dietary restrictions, the number of attendees with each condition, and any other relevant details. You may also want to include a clear plan for the menu and buffet layout to minimize cross-contamination risks. For labeling, use clear and visible signage to indicate \"Nut-Free\" or \"Vegan\" next to each item, and consider using colorful stickers or icons to differentiate between options.",
