    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the sticker idea is good but i'm worried about the buffet line getting too crowded or people accidentally grabbing the wrong thing if they're rushing. do you have any specific ideas for how to layout the stations to keep the nut-free stuff totally separate? like, should we have a dedicated station just for them or just space them out?",
